post_install() {
    cat <<'EOF'
==> omarchy-side-mouse-button-mapper: one more step before it'll work.

Reading raw mouse events needs your user in the 'input' group (not
something a package install can safely do for you -- it'd need to guess
which user). Run:

    sudo usermod -aG input $USER

then log out and back in. Or use the helper script from the repo:

    https://github.com/GSkrt/omarchy-side-mouse-button-mapper/blob/main/scripts/setup-input-group.sh
EOF
}
